{"sha": "b6251b318d4151320005385dfa9a15c8ec02308c1d798e4b426e1fbf029de03b", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:phase-changes} 章 --- 纯物质的相变}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:phase-changes:1}", "(a) 蒸气：\\qty{0.5}{kPa} 低于 $P_s(\\qty{20}{\\degreeCelsius}) = \\qty{2.3}{kPa}$。", "(b) 固体。(c) 高于 $T_c = \\qty{374}{\\degreeCelsius}$：超临界流体，", "不存在液气之分。(d) 三相点：三相共存。水洼", "从表面蒸发，只要空气中的蒸气压", "低于 $P_s(\\qty{20}{\\degreeCelsius})$；沸腾只发生在", "液体内部能形成气泡的情形。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:phase-changes:2}", "$0.1 \\times 2257 + 0.1 \\times 4.18\\,(100 - T_f) = 1.0 \\times 4.18\\,(T_f - 20)$：", "$351.1 = 4.60\\,T_f$，$T_f = \\qty{76}{\\degreeCelsius}$。若改用热水", "则 $100 - T_f = 10(T_f - 20)$，$T_f = \\qty{27}{\\degreeCelsius}$ ---", "潜热相当于 \\qty{540}{K} 的显热。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:phase-changes:3}", "$v = \\qty{2.0e-3}{m^3/kg}$；$x = (2.0 - 1.09) \\times 10^{-3}/0.392 = 2.3 \\times 10^{-3}$：", "\\qty{2.3}{g} 的蒸气充满 \\qty{0.91}{L}；\\qty{0.998}{kg} 的液体", "占有体积 $0.998 \\times 1.09 = \\qty{1.09}{L}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:phase-changes:4}", "$2257/373 = \\qty{6.05}{kJ/(kg.K)}$，即 $\\times 0.018 = \\qty{109}{J/(mol.K)}$；", "熔化 $334/273 \\times 0.018 = \\qty{22}{J/(mol.K)}$。水的 $109$ 明显", "高于特鲁顿规则的 $88$：氢键使液态水比普通液体更有序，", "因此汽化时无序度增加得更多。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:phase-changes:5}", "$1/T = 1/373.15 - \\ln(P/P_0)/4890$。珠峰：$\\ln(0.33/1.013) = -1.12$，", "$1/T = 2.680 \\times 10^{-3} + 2.29 \\times 10^{-4}$，$T = \\qty{344}{K} =", "\\qty{71}{\\degreeCelsius}$。在 \\qty{0.80}{bar} 时：$\\ln = -0.236$，$T = \\qty{366}{K} =", "\\qty{93}{\\degreeCelsius}$。在 \\qty{71}{\\degreeCelsius} 时，蛋清凝固得很慢，", "蛋黄几乎不凝固：\\qty{3}{min} 的鸡蛋变成", "\\qty{10}{min} 甚至更久的鸡蛋。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:phase-changes:6}", "$\\ln(1.8/1.013) = 0.575$：$1/T = 2.680 \\times 10^{-3} - 1.18 \\times 10^{-4}$，", "$T = \\qty{390}{K} = \\qty{117}{\\degreeCelsius}$；在 \\qty{2.5}{bar} 时：$\\ln = 0.903$，", "$T = \\qty{401}{K} = \\qty{128}{\\degreeCelsius}$。蒸汽：$\\qty{2}{L}/0.98 =", "\\qty{2.0}{g}$ --- 高压锅内几乎只有水和少量", "蒸汽。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:phase-changes:7}", "$\\dd P/\\dd T = 3.34 \\times 10^5/[273 \\times (-9.1 \\times 10^{-5})] = \\qty{-1.3e7}{Pa/K}", "= \\qty{-130}{bar/K}$：冰在", "约 \\qty{130}{bar} 的压强下于 \\qty{-1}{\\degreeCelsius} 熔化。在 \\qty{3}{km} 厚的冰层之下，$P = 917 \\times 9.8 \\times 3000 =", "\\qty{270}{bar}$：熔点降至 \\qty{-2}{\\degreeCelsius}；冰川底部可以处于", "熔点，而表面远比它冷，并且由", "融水形成的薄膜使冰盖得以滑动。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:phase-changes:8}", "$W = -P(v_v - v_l) = -1.013 \\times 10^5 \\times 1.672 = \\qty{-169}{kJ}$（水把", "大气推回）；$Q = L_v = \\qty{2257}{kJ}$；$\\Delta U = 2257 - 169", "= \\qty{2088}{kJ}$；$\\Delta H = \\qty{2257}{kJ}$；$\\Delta S = 2257/373 = \\qty{6.05}{kJ/K}$。", "若热源为 \\qty{1500}{K} 的火焰：$S_{\\mathrm{exch}} = 2257/1500 = \\qty{1.50}{kJ/K}$，", "产生熵 \\qty{4.5}{kJ/K} --- 火焰的大部分品质都浪费在加热", "水上。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:phase-changes:9}", "$P_s(\\qty{22}{\\degreeCelsius}) \\approx 2.34 + 0.4 \\times 0.83 = \\qty{2.67}{kPa}$，", "$P_v = 0.70 \\times 2.67 = \\qty{1.87}{kPa}$；露点满足 $P_s = 1.87$：$15 +", "5 \\times 0.17/0.64 = \\qty{16}{\\degreeCelsius}$。质量：$\\rho_v = 1870 \\times 0.018/", "(8.314 \\times 295) = \\qty{13.7}{g/m^3}$，房间内共 \\qty{0.69}{kg}。玻璃窗温度为", "\\qty{12}{\\degreeCelsius}：$P_s \\approx \\qty{1.42}{kPa} < 1.87$，窗户起雾。在", "\\qty{25}{\\degreeCelsius} 时，湿度降至 $1.87/3.17 = 59\\%$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:phase-changes:10}", "(a) $h$ 是状态函数：经固 $\\to$ 液 $\\to$ 汽（在", "三相点处）或由固 $\\to$ 汽直接转变，得到的 $\\Delta h$ 相同：", "$L_s = L_f + L_v$。(b) 由于 $v_s, v_l \\ll v_v$，两条斜率均为 $L/(Tv_v)$，", "在相同的 $T$ 与 $v_v$ 下，二者之比为 $L_s/L_v > 1$。(c) $v_v = RT/(MP) =", "8.314 \\times 273.16/(0.018 \\times 611) = \\qty{206}{m^3/kg}$；汽化为", "$2.50 \\times 10^6/(273.16 \\times 206) = \\qty{44}{Pa/K}$，升华为 $2.83 \\times 10^6/", "(273.16 \\times 206) = \\qty{50}{Pa/K}$。(d) 在 \\qty{0}{\\degreeCelsius} 以下，", "\\qty{1}{bar} 下不存在液体；若空气中的蒸气压低于", "冰面上的 $P_s$（\\qty{-10}{\\degreeCelsius} 时为 \\qty{260}{Pa}），则雪", "升华 --- 干冷的风把雪吹走。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:phase-changes:11}", "(a) $P_s(\\qty{105}{\\degreeCelsius}) \\approx 1.013 + 5 \\times 0.036 = \\qty{1.19}{bar}$：", "$\\Delta P = \\qty{0.18}{bar}$，$r^\\ast = 2 \\times 0.059/(1.8 \\times 10^4) = \\qty{6.6}{\\micro m}$。", "(b) $\\Delta P = \\qty{3.6}{kPa}$，$r^\\ast = \\qty{33}{\\micro m}$。(c) $x = c\\,\\Delta T/L_v =", "4.18 \\times 5/2257 = 0.93\\%$：每升水约 \\qty{9.3}{g}，即 $9.3 \\times 10^{-3}", "\\times 1.67 = \\qty{16}{L}$ 的蒸汽，在极短时间内于", "杯内产生 --- 水被喷出，即沸腾。(d) 薯片的", "孔隙中含有空气：已存在数十微米量级的气泡，因此", "只要 $P_s$ 达到 $P_0$，沸腾便开始。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:phase-changes:12}", "(a) 节流阀之后 $h = \\qty{256}{kJ/kg}$，温度为 \\qty{-10}{\\degreeCelsius}：$x =", "(256 - 187)/(392 - 187) = 0.34$。(b) 蒸发器 $q_c = 392 - 256 =", "\\qty{136}{kJ/kg}$；压缩机 $w = 430 - 392 = \\qty{38}{kJ/kg}$；冷凝器", "$q_h = 256 - 430 = \\qty{-174}{kJ/kg}$；$136 + 38 - 174 = 0$。(c) $e_p =", "174/38 = 4.6$，$e_f = 136/38 = 3.6$；卡诺 $313/50 = 6.3$ 和 $263/50 =", "5.3$：约为理想值的 $0.7$。(d) $\\dot m = 6000/174000 = \\qty{34}{g/s}$，", "每分钟 \\qty{2.1}{kg}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:phase-changes:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 在 \\qty{1}{atm} 下，水于 \\qty{100}{\\degreeCelsius} 沸腾；只要", "仍有液体，所供给的任何热量都用来产生该温度下的蒸气", "（潜热），而不是使液体升温：温度", "由压强决定，保持不变。", ""]}